'''Gligar''' (Japanese: '''グライガー''' ''Gliger'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Wisdom of Sea and Sky}} expansion.

